  "content": "<h1>灵魂绑定附魔</h1><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1327308441324097681?label=discord&amp;color=blue&amp;logo=discord\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fly-soulbound-enchantment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/ly-soulbound-enchantment?label=modrinth&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/data-packs/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/license/lullaby6/data-packs\" alt=\"许可证\"></a></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><code>灵魂绑定</code>附魔可在玩家死亡时保留物品。</p><p>该附魔可通过附魔台、战利品箱或与村民交易获得。</p><p>实际上与<code>doImmediateRespawn</code>游戏规则不兼容。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>❗ 兼容性</h2><ul>\n<li>与<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fdatapack%252fly-graves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">墓碑模组</a>兼容！</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>👾 漏洞/问题反馈</h2><p>请在<a href=\"https://discord.gg/5UdcDa5xNC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord服务器</a>中报告任何问题/漏洞。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>⌨️ 指令</h2><p>给予物品：</p><pre><code>/loot give @s loot soulbound_enchantment:soulbound</code></pre><p>附魔操作：</p><pre><code>/enchant @s soulbound_enchantment:soulbound</code></pre><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>🪪 许可证</h2><p><a href=\"https://github.com/lullaby6/enchantments-data-pack/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">AGPL-3.0-or-later</a></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>💌 捐赠支持</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252flullaby45743\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">通过Ko-Fi捐赠</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fpaypalme%252flucianobrumer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">通过PayPal捐赠</a></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><h2>🎁 服务器托管</h2><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-ba